OK, I solved it.  The default load factor for queueing messages in
sendmail is:
# load average at which we just queue messages
#O QueueLA=8

which I changed to:
Ox20

(more appropriate to a 4 cpu ES40)

and restarted sendmail.

Size is apparently also a factor, but I haven't found where it's set
yet.

Thanks to  Nikola Milutinovic for some useful insights.

Regards,
Peter

